<script setup>
import {ref,computed,onMounted} from 'vue'
import {api,post,portLabel} from './quotationApi'
const props=defineProps({identity:String}),emit=defineEmits(['drafts','uploads'])
const result=ref(null),selected=ref([]),error=ref(''),message=ref(''),busy=ref(false),page=ref(1)
const visible=computed(()=>result.value?.rows.slice((page.value-1)*20,page.value*20)||[])
async function load(){result.value=await api('/api/ai/imports/'+props.identity);selected.value=result.value.status==='committed'?result.value.selection:result.value.rows.map(r=>r.id)}
async function commit(){busy.value=true;error.value='';try{const r=await post(`/api/ai/imports/${props.identity}/commit`,{row_ids:selected.value});await load();message.value=`已生成${r.created}条未审批草稿；请进入草稿编辑和校对，尚未发布。`}catch(e){error.value=e.message}finally{busy.value=false}}
onMounted(async()=>{try{await load()}catch(e){error.value=e.message}})
</script>
<template><section><div class="catalog-heading"><div><h2>AI报价提取与校对</h2><p>DeepSeek识别结果可能存在误读；先核对原文与来源位置，选行生成草稿，再编辑和提交审批。</p></div><button class="small-button" @click="emit('uploads')">返回原件与任务</button></div>
<p v-if="error" class="feedback error" role="alert">{{error}}</p><p v-if="message" class="feedback success" role="status">{{message}}</p>
<template v-if="result"><p>原件：{{result.filename}} · {{result.model}} · 共{{result.counts.total}}行 <a :href="`/api/uploads/files/${result.file_id}/original`" download>下载原件核对</a></p><p class="quote-banner">AI不会替你确认起运港、适用条件或零运费。缺失／歧义字段保留待确认，不补猜币种、年份或价格。原始结果与后续人工修改分别保存。</p><p v-for="(n,i) in result.notes" :key="i">{{n}}</p>
<div v-if="result.status==='preview'" class="form-actions"><button class="small-button" @click="selected=result.rows.map(r=>r.id)">选择全部</button><button class="small-button" @click="selected=[]">清空选择</button><button class="small-button primary" :disabled="busy||!selected.length" @click="commit">将选中{{selected.length}}行生成草稿</button></div><button v-else class="small-button primary" @click="emit('drafts')">进入草稿编辑与校对</button>
<article v-for="r in visible" :key="r.id" class="ai-row"><label><input type="checkbox" :value="r.id" v-model="selected" :disabled="result.status==='committed'||busy">选择报价行</label><h3>{{portLabel(r.display.origin)}} → {{portLabel(r.display.destination)}}</h3><p>{{r.display.carrier?.name||'船公司待匹配'}} · {{r.display.supplier?.name||'供应商待匹配'}} / {{r.display.series?.name||'报价系列待匹配'}}</p><p><b>{{r.data.currency||'币种待确认'}}</b> · 20GP {{r.data.prices['20GP']??'缺价'}} · 40GP {{r.data.prices['40GP']??'缺价'}} · 40HQ {{r.data.prices['40HQ']??'缺价'}}</p><p>有效期：{{r.data.valid_from||'起日待补齐'}} ～ {{r.data.valid_to||'止日待补齐'}} · 依据 {{r.data.validity_basis||'待确认'}}</p><p>服务：{{r.data.service_key||'待确认'}} · 路径：{{r.data.path_text||'未说明'}} · 费用口径：{{r.data.fee_basis||'待确认'}}</p><p>已含：{{r.data.included_fees}} · 另计：{{r.data.extra_fees}} · 待确认：{{r.data.unknown_fees}}</p><p>适用条件：{{r.data.conditions||'原文未说明'}} · 备注：{{r.data.remark||'无'}}</p><ul class="feedback error"><li v-for="(n,i) in [...r.mapping_notes,...r.issues.map(i=>i.message)]" :key="i">{{n}}</li></ul><details><summary>原文证据、表头与脚注</summary><p v-for="s in r.sources" :key="s.id"><b>{{s.worksheet||''}} {{s.cell_range||''}} {{s.page?`第${s.page}页／张`:''}}</b> {{s.excerpt}}<small v-if="s.region"> · 图像区域 {{s.region}}</small></p></details><details><summary>原始AI字段及证据对应关系</summary><pre>{{JSON.stringify(r.raw,null,2)}}</pre></details></article>
<div class="form-actions" v-if="result.rows.length>20"><button class="small-button" :disabled="page<=1" @click="page--">上一页</button><span>{{page}} / {{Math.ceil(result.rows.length/20)}}</span><button class="small-button" :disabled="page*20>=result.rows.length" @click="page++">下一页</button></div></template></section></template>
<style scoped>.ai-row{background:white;border:1px solid #dbe4ed;border-radius:12px;padding:20px;margin:16px 0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;max-height:400px;overflow:auto}.ai-row p{line-height:1.65}</style>
